Backport Waybar Lua IPC support to 0.15.0.

Runtime portions of upstream commits:
  e17c0d9f0a73acc370df60ec8c532b1ed2385c73 (Lua dispatch)
  cdb792af41e78d01263c2152d8b5050c40705ea9 (move-to-monitor argument)
  bfd0cfee3bc763d92b9845865542d8b5920f1cdd (configProvider detection)
  92742e46b1e512951a4bbdf1e4fd052ce109f1b4 (simplified detection)

The earlier version/probe detection is intentionally not used. Hyprland
0.55+ supports both config formats, and detection must not switch workspaces.
Scroll dispatch is absent from 0.15.0, so only its existing click handlers
need conversion. Remove once nixpkgs ships Waybar with these fixes.

